# Fetched evaluation data. Both forms on purpose: a real directory, and the
# symlink we use to keep the bulk data on the 20TB volume. The trailing-slash
# form does not match a symlink, so without the second line git would try to
# commit a machine-specific absolute path into the code submission.
/local-data/
/local-data
/local-data-dev
local-data-dev/
metaeval/
models/
nohup.out

